<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS5" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ Unveiling LLMs’ Metaphorical Understanding: Exploring Conceptual Irrelevance, Context Leveraging and Syntactic Influence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.5 </span>The Prompt of Syntactic Shuffle</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS6" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ Unveiling LLMs’ Metaphorical Understanding: Exploring Conceptual Irrelevance, Context Leveraging and Syntactic Influence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.6 </span>Distribution of (<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{p}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\cos\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cos\theta</annotation></semantics></math>) and (<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{p}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="Ad" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Ad</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS7" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ Unveiling LLMs’ Metaphorical Understanding: Exploring Conceptual Irrelevance, Context Leveraging and Syntactic Influence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.7 </span>Overlap Ratio of Imagination Word Sets</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
