<span id="S5.T3.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:45.5pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">The monks were not honorable.</span>
</span></span>
</span></th>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:82.5pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">The monks had the honor of a knight.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.7pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">… were highly respected.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.7pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">… had a prestigious recognition.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.6.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.3pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">0.1153</span>
</span></td>
