<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>The overlap ratio of metaphorical imagination from literal to metaphor (LM) and from metaphor to literal (ML). <span id="S5.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">News</span>, <span id="S5.T4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fiction</span>, <span id="S5.T4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Academic</span> and <span id="S5.T4.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Conversation</span> are four included genres. The best values are in bold and the second-best are underlined.</figcaption>
</figure>
